@Convention Center Station Closed for Station Improvement ProjectenZ¡
æ
∑The Convention Center Station is temporarily closed for several months due to a station improvement project including maintenance, repairs and upgrades. There is no MetroLink access at the station. The station is expected to reopen when the project is completed in the spring.
A Metro Shuttle is operating during the closure between the Civic Center and Convention Center MetroLink Stations to assist you when youre traveling to or from destinations near Convention Center. The Metro Shuttle van operates every 25 minutes. Visit the NextStop blog for more details.
